      explanation: "When we place a mirror on the line PQ, then letters that appear on the left will appear on the right side and the letters that appear on the right side will appear on the left. The letter Q appearing on the extreme right end will shift to the extreme left end and tail of Q will also appear on the left, meaning it will not remain the same after shifting; similarly, T will appear on the extreme right end, etc.",
