      explanation: "Given: 625 : 5 :: 2560 : 8 :: 5000 : ? Logic: 625 × 2 = 1250 = (5)3 × 10 2560 × 2 = 5120 = (8)3 × 10 So, 5000 × 2 = 10000 = (10)3 × 10 Hence, the missing number is 10. = 3 C 9 E D S Z ↑ D",
