      explanation: "l 1st letters: M(13) → P(16) → S(19) → +3 ⇒ V(22) l 2nd letters: Z(26) → X(24) → V(22) → –2 ⇒ T(20) l 3rd letters: M(13) → K(11) → I(9) → –2 ⇒ G(7) So, the next term is V T G.",
