      explanation: "Given that (x – 5)2 + (y –2)2 + (z – 9)2 = 0 ∴ x – 5 = 0, y – 2 = 0, and z – 9 = 0 So, x = 5, y = 2 and z = 9 Now, x + y – z = 5 + 2 – 9 = –2",
