      options: ["8,500", "6,800", "8,000", "6,500"], answer: 3,
      explanation: "MRP of the article = ` 10,000 As per the question, 10 000 80 100 90 100 100 100 , × × × −k = 6120 ⇒ 100 – k = 6 120 72 , ⇒ 100 – k = 85 ⇒ k = 100 – 85 = 15 So, selling price after allowing 35% discount = 10,000 × 65 100 = ` 6,500",
