      explanation: "The number of cars passing the road near the colony from 6 am-12 noon has been shown in the given histogram. No. of cars passed between 6 am - 8 am = 70 + 105 = 175 No. of cars passed between 9 am - 11 am = 115 + 95 = 210 The ratio = 175 : 210 = 5 : 6 Therefore, ratio of the number of cars passed between 6 am - 8 am to the number of cars passed between 9 am - 11 am is 5 : 6.",
