      explanation: "The monthly expenditure of a family on different heads is shown in the given pie chart. Expenditure on different Heads Rent 60° Misc Expanses 75° Children Education Saving 40° Transport 50° Food 65° 70° Total angle of all expenditures = 75° +60° +70° + 65° +50° + 40° = 360° Total angle of the amount spent on Children’s Education, Transport and Rent = 70° + 50° +60° = 180° The percentage = 180 360 100    × = 50% So, amount spent on Children’s Education, Transport and Rent is 50% of the total earnings.",
